<view class="page mine-page {{reduce?'reduce-motion':''}}"><view class="profile"><view class="profile-mark">自然</view><view><view class="title">设置与服务</view><view class="sub">本机收藏 · 云端服务按授权使用</view></view></view>
<view class="settings-sections"><button class="secondary" data-section="settings" bindtap="changeSection">设置</button><button class="secondary" data-section="membership" bindtap="changeSection">会员与用量</button><button class="secondary" data-section="privacy" bindtap="changeSection">隐私</button><button class="secondary" data-section="help" bindtap="changeSection">帮助与反馈</button><button class="secondary" data-section="about" bindtap="changeSection">关于</button><button class="secondary" data-section="friends" bindtap="changeSection">好友与纪念卡</button></view>
<view wx:if="{{section==='settings'}}" class="panel spaced">
 <view class="section">呈现与动效</view><view class="sub spaced">只影响本机呈现，不改变已保存的数据。</view>
 <view class="setting-card"><view><view class="section">减少动态效果</view><view class="sub">关闭倾斜与揭页动效，翻面直接切换</view></view><switch checked="{{reduce}}" color="#4A7C59" bindchange="motion" aria-label="减少动态效果"/></view>
 <view class="setting-card"><view><view class="section">本机显示已保存地点</view><view class="sub">仅使用卡片中已保存的地点信息，不显示精确坐标或分钟级时间</view></view><switch checked="{{showLocation}}" color="#4A7C59" bindchange="placeVisibility" aria-label="本机显示已保存地点"/></view>
</view>
<view wx:if="{{section==='settings'}}" class="panel spaced"><view class="section">本地备份与清除</view><view class="sub spaced">备份包含笔记和本地图片路径；图片请单独导出，文件不会自动上传。</view><button class="secondary spaced" disabled="{{clearing || exportBusy}}" bindtap="exportData">导出本地记录 JSON</button><view wx:if="{{exportPath}}" class="row spaced"><button class="secondary grow" bindtap="saveBackup">发送备份文件</button><button class="secondary grow" bindtap="copyBackup">复制 JSON</button></view><button wx:if="{{cleanup}}" class="secondary spaced" bindtap="retry">重试清理 {{cleanup}} 个本地文件</button><view wx:if="{{cloudCleanup}}" class="sub spaced">删除卡片时云端清理未确认的观察会排队在此，联网后可重试。</view><button wx:if="{{cloudCleanup}}" class="secondary spaced" disabled="{{cloudCleanupBusy}}" bindtap="retryCloudCleanup">重试清理 {{cloudCleanup}} 条云端照片</button><button class="secondary spaced danger" disabled="{{clearing}}" bindtap="clear">{{clearing?'正在清理…':'清除全部本地数据'}}</button></view>
<view wx:if="{{section==='privacy'}}" class="panel spaced">
 <view class="section">云端卡片恢复</view><view class="sub spaced">默认关闭。开启后读取你已成功保存的云端物种、发现编号、插画与私有原照片，并将卡片及照片保存到本机；不会上传现有本地收藏、笔记或地点。此授权独立于百度照片鉴别。</view><view class="setting-card"><text>允许恢复本人云端卡片</text><switch checked="{{recoveryConsent}}" disabled="{{recoveryBusy}}" bindchange="recoveryConsentChange" aria-label="允许恢复本人云端卡片"/></view><view class="sub">关闭后停止后续恢复与新的私有图片链接发放；已发出的临时链接最长仍可用10分钟。已有本地或云端记录不会自动删除，需单独删除卡片或申请清除。撤销失败时会明确提示是否已排队，不会宣称成功。</view><view wx:if="{{recoveryMessage}}" class="sub spaced" aria-live="polite">{{recoveryMessage}}</view>
</view>
<view wx:if="{{section==='privacy'}}" class="panel spaced">
 <view class="section">云端个人数据清除</view>
 <view class="sub spaced">独立于本机清除。清理过程中该账号暂停生成及分享；支付对账记录与公共物种插画不在删除范围。</view>
 <view wx:if="{{privacyMessage}}" class="sub spaced" aria-live="polite">{{privacyMessage}}</view>
 <button class="secondary spaced" disabled="{{privacyBusy}}" bindtap="checkCloudPrivacy">查询云端清理状态</button>
 <button wx:if="{{privacyStatus==='processing'||privacyStatus==='failed'}}" class="secondary spaced" disabled="{{privacyBusy}}" bindtap="continueCloudErasure">继续清理 / 重试</button>
 <button wx:elif="{{privacyStatus!=='erased'}}" class="secondary spaced danger" disabled="{{privacyBusy}}" bindtap="requestCloudErasure">申请清除云端个人数据</button>
</view>
<view wx:if="{{section==='privacy'}}" class="panel spaced"><view class="section">隐私</view><view class="sub spaced">地点默认隐藏；开关已收拢到「设置」。仅在你主动选择时使用地点接口，不自动采集或上传位置。公开卡片始终显示“地点未公开”，不包含精确坐标。</view><view class="sub">头像只保存在本机，不代表微信认证。反馈不会自动上传照片或笔记。</view></view>
<view wx:if="{{section==='help'}}" class="panel spaced"><view class="section">帮助与反馈</view><view class="help-copy">拍一张 → 鉴别并确认物种 → 生成彩绘卡 → 收入馆藏。识别或生成失败时不会保存失败卡，可重试。</view><view class="help-copy">相机或相册无法使用：检查微信系统权限。识别失败：检查网络，并核对下方鉴别照片同意设置。导出失败：确认照片仍可读取与本机空间充足。</view><view class="sub">点击下方通过微信主动提交反馈，也可复制模板。不会自动附带照片、位置、日志或私人笔记。</view><button class="primary spaced" open-type="feedback">通过微信提交反馈</button><button class="secondary spaced" bindtap="copyFeedback">复制反馈模板</button></view>
<view wx:if="{{section==='about'}}" class="panel spaced"><view class="section">关于去大自然里</view><view class="sub spaced">版本 {{version}}</view><view class="help-copy">用真实相遇建立自然收藏：自然、珍藏、可信。尊重生命与栖息环境，不捕捉、不打扰。</view><view class="help-copy">卡面插画与勋章图形由 AI 生成，是自然观察的艺术纪念，不是鉴别依据。物种资料有局限，不能用于食用、安全或医疗判断；识别不确定时请谨慎确认。</view><view class="sub">本地头像不代表微信认证。会员与好友仅在主动连接服务、通过身份及权限校验后可用；未完成服务端配置前均为未开放状态。</view></view>
<view wx:if="{{section==='membership'}}" class="panel spaced">
 <view class="section">会员与用量</view><view class="help-copy">月度 ¥19.9 / 月 · 年度 ¥198 / 年</view><view class="sub">年度比逐月购买省 ¥40.8。会员每月30次创作，官方物种插画复用不扣创作次数。额度以服务端账本为准。</view>
 <view class="help-copy" aria-live="polite">{{membershipLabel||'尚未查询会员服务；未完成商户配置前为未开放状态，不代表已开通。'}}</view>
 <view wx:if="{{paymentLabel}}" class="sub spaced" aria-live="polite">{{paymentLabel}}</view>
 <button class="secondary spaced" disabled="{{serviceBusy}}" bindtap="connectMembership">连接服务 / 查询支付结果</button>
 <view wx:if="{{membershipConnected}}" class="row spaced"><button class="secondary grow" disabled="{{serviceBusy}}" data-plan="monthly" bindtap="buyMembership">购买月度</button><button class="secondary grow" disabled="{{serviceBusy}}" data-plan="annual" bindtap="buyMembership">购买年度</button></view>
 <view class="sub spaced">只有商户配置有效才可付款；支付返回成功不等于会员生效，需服务端核验订单。未完成支付可再次查询，不会本机自行开通。</view>
</view>
<view wx:if="{{section==='friends'}}" class="panel spaced">
 <view class="section">好友与纪念卡</view><view class="sub spaced">主动连接后使用微信身份查询本人好友。仅分享你明确选择的物种资料；原照片、地点、笔记保持私有。纪念副本须持有人批准，不计发现数量。</view>
 <view class="section spaced">喜欢你的发现</view>
 <view class="sub">仅你可查看有效分享上的好友点赞。这是手动查询，不是通知或公开热度；对方未开启资料分享时显示匿名。</view>
 <button class="secondary spaced" disabled="{{serviceBusy}}" bindtap="loadReceivedLikes">查看 / 刷新好友点赞</button>
 <view wx:if="{{receivedLikesLoaded&&!receivedLikes.length}}" class="sub">本页暂无有效点赞。分享撤回、来源删除或好友关系变化后不再返回。</view>
 <view wx:for="{{receivedLikes}}" wx:key="shareId" class="service-row"><view>{{item.liker.nickname}}<view class="sub">喜欢你的「{{item.species.speciesName}}」</view></view></view>
 <button wx:if="{{receivedLikesCursor}}" class="secondary spaced" disabled="{{serviceBusy}}" data-more="{{true}}" bindtap="loadReceivedLikes">查看下一页点赞</button>
 <view class="section spaced">我的资料分享</view><view class="sub">默认关闭。头像是原创符号，不上传本机头像照片；昵称由你主动填写，不自动获取微信资料。</view><button class="secondary spaced" disabled="{{serviceBusy}}" bindtap="loadSharedProfile">查询我的分享设置</button><block wx:if="{{sharedProfile}}"><input class="service-input spaced" maxlength="24" value="{{profileNickname}}" bindinput="profileNicknameInput" placeholder="主动设置昵称，不填写联系方式" aria-label="向好友公开的昵称"/><view class="row spaced"><button class="secondary grow" data-symbol="leaf" bindtap="profileAvatarChoose">叶</button><button class="secondary grow" data-symbol="bird" bindtap="profileAvatarChoose">羽</button><button class="secondary grow" data-symbol="sun" bindtap="profileAvatarChoose">光</button><button class="secondary grow" data-symbol="mountain" bindtap="profileAvatarChoose">山</button></view><view class="sub">头像符号：{{profileAvatar}}</view><view class="setting-card"><text>允许好友查看资料与明确分享的收藏</text><switch checked="{{sharedProfile.enabled}}" disabled="{{serviceBusy}}" bindchange="profileSharingChange" aria-label="允许好友查看主动分享的资料"/></view><button wx:if="{{sharedProfile.enabled}}" class="secondary" disabled="{{serviceBusy}}" data-save-profile="{{true}}" bindtap="saveSharedProfile">保存昵称与符号修改</button></block><button class="secondary spaced" disabled="{{serviceBusy}}" bindtap="connectFriends">连接 / 刷新好友服务</button>
 <block wx:if="{{socialConnected}}">
  <view class="help-copy">已连接 {{friends.length}} 位好友</view><button class="secondary" disabled="{{serviceBusy}}" bindtap="createFriendInvite">生成15分钟邀请码</button><button wx:if="{{inviteCode}}" class="secondary spaced" bindtap="copyFriendInvite">复制邀请码</button><view class="sub">{{inviteMessage}}</view>
  <input class="service-input spaced" value="{{enteredInvite}}" bindinput="inviteInput" maxlength="128" placeholder="粘贴好友邀请码" aria-label="好友邀请码"/><button class="secondary spaced" disabled="{{serviceBusy}}" bindtap="acceptFriendInvite">接受邀请</button>
  <view wx:for="{{friends}}" wx:key="relationshipId" class="service-row"><button class="link" data-id="{{item.relationshipId}}" bindtap="openFriendMuseum">好友 {{index+1}} · 自然馆</button><button class="secondary" disabled="{{serviceBusy}}" data-id="{{item.relationshipId}}" bindtap="removeFriend">解除关系</button></view>
  <button class="primary spaced" disabled="{{serviceBusy}}" bindtap="shareSpecies">选择物种与好友分享</button><view class="sub">{{shareMessage}}</view><button wx:if="{{lastShareId}}" class="secondary spaced" disabled="{{serviceBusy}}" bindtap="revokeLastShare">撤回本次分享</button>
  <view class="section spaced">我发出的分享</view><button class="secondary spaced" disabled="{{serviceBusy}}" bindtap="loadSentShares">查看 / 刷新分享历史</button><view wx:if="{{sentSharesLoaded&&!sentShares.length}}" class="sub">暂无分享记录。</view><view wx:for="{{sentShares}}" wx:key="shareId" class="service-row"><view>{{item.species.speciesName}}<view class="sub">{{item.shared?'分享记录有效':'已撤回分享'}}{{item.liked?' · 对方已赞':''}}</view></view><view class="social-card-actions"><button wx:if="{{item.shared}}" class="secondary" disabled="{{serviceBusy}}" data-id="{{item.shareId}}" bindtap="toggleFeaturedShare">{{item.featured?'取消精选':'设为精选'}}</button><button wx:if="{{item.shared}}" class="secondary" disabled="{{serviceBusy}}" data-id="{{item.shareId}}" bindtap="revokeSentShare">撤回分享</button><button wx:if="{{item.giftedCopyId}}" class="secondary" disabled="{{serviceBusy}}" data-id="{{item.giftedCopyId}}" data-source="{{true}}" bindtap="removeGiftedCopy">撤回副本</button></view></view><button wx:if="{{sentShareCursor}}" class="secondary spaced" disabled="{{serviceBusy}}" data-more="{{true}}" bindtap="loadSentShares">查看更多分享</button><view class="section spaced">好友公开物种</view><view wx:if="{{!sharedSpecies.length}}" class="sub">还没有好友向你分享物种。</view><view wx:for="{{sharedSpecies}}" wx:key="shareId" class="service-row"><text>{{item.species.speciesName}}</text><view class="social-card-actions"><button class="secondary" disabled="{{serviceBusy}}" data-id="{{item.shareId}}" bindtap="toggleSpeciesLike" aria-label="{{item.liked?'取消点赞':'点赞'}}">{{item.liked?'已赞 · 取消':'点赞'}}</button><button class="secondary" disabled="{{serviceBusy}}" data-id="{{item.shareId}}" bindtap="requestMemorial">请求收藏副本</button></view></view>
  <view class="section spaced">我的收藏请求</view><view wx:if="{{!myCopyRequests.length}}" class="sub">暂无请求。</view><view wx:for="{{myCopyRequests}}" wx:key="copyRequestId" class="service-row"><view>{{item.species.speciesName}}<view class="sub">{{item.stateLabel}}</view></view><button wx:if="{{item.state==='pending'}}" class="secondary" disabled="{{serviceBusy}}" data-id="{{item.copyRequestId}}" bindtap="cancelMyRequest">取消申请</button></view><view class="section spaced">等待我批准</view><view wx:if="{{!copyRequests.length}}" class="sub">暂无请求。</view><view wx:for="{{copyRequests}}" wx:key="copyRequestId" class="spaced"><view>{{item.species.speciesName}}</view><view class="row"><button class="secondary grow" disabled="{{serviceBusy}}" data-id="{{item.copyRequestId}}" data-decision="approveCopy" bindtap="decideCopy">批准</button><button class="secondary grow" disabled="{{serviceBusy}}" data-id="{{item.copyRequestId}}" data-decision="rejectCopy" bindtap="decideCopy">拒绝</button></view></view>
  <view class="section spaced">受赠收藏副本</view><view wx:if="{{!memorialCopies.length}}" class="sub">暂无获批准的纪念副本。</view><view wx:for="{{memorialCopies}}" wx:key="id" class="service-row"><view>{{item.species.speciesName}}<view class="sub">来源：匿名收藏者批准的物种记录 · 不计发现或勋章</view></view><button class="secondary" disabled="{{serviceBusy}}" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="removeGiftedCopy">删除副本</button></view>
 </block>
</view>
<view wx:if="{{serviceError}}" class="panel spaced" aria-live="polite">{{serviceError}}</view>
<block wx:if="{{section==='privacy'}}"><view class="setting-card"><view><view class="section">允许百度鉴别照片</view><view class="sub">仅在点击识别时上传所选照片至私有云并发送百度；关闭后须重新同意。</view></view><switch checked="{{recognitionConsent}}" color="#647B42" bindchange="recognitionConsentChange"/></view>
</block><view wx:if="{{section==='privacy'}}" class="panel spaced"><view class="section">运营工具</view><view class="sub spaced">输入激活码即可自助开通运营权限；开通后可手动触发日聚合、查看数据看板与额度。</view><input wx:if="{{!opsClaimed}}" class="service-input spaced" value="{{opsCode}}" bindinput="opsCodeInput" maxlength="64" placeholder="输入运营激活码" aria-label="运营激活码"/><button wx:if="{{!opsClaimed}}" class="secondary spaced" disabled="{{opsBusy}}" bindtap="claimOperator">激活为运营</button><view wx:if="{{opsClaimed}}" class="row spaced"><button class="secondary grow" disabled="{{opsBusy}}" bindtap="opsAggregateYesterday">聚合昨天</button><button class="secondary grow" disabled="{{opsBusy}}" bindtap="opsDashboard">看板近7天</button><button class="secondary grow" disabled="{{opsBusy}}" bindtap="opsQuota">查看额度</button></view><view wx:if="{{opsMessage}}" class="sub spaced" aria-live="polite">{{opsMessage}}</view><view wx:if="{{opsResult}}" class="ops-result spaced" aria-live="polite">{{opsResult}}</view></view></view><navigation active="settings"/>
<privacy-consent id="nature-privacy"/>
